defNames renamed AA_/RG_Plant_/AB_/VFEI2_/bare -> RSW_, namespace
RimMandrake.StarWars per design/NAMING_SCHEME_PLAN.md. Names are DRAFTED
pseudo-Star-Wars names (NONCANON_BEAST_RENAME_1) - owner has not ruled on them.

